# THE SCREEN IN BANDS: each track's row and the foot are drawn only when what they show changed, and
# what they leave on the screen is what drawing it all anew draws: while it plays, over the counted
# beats, through a knob's box and its fade, a mute, another track, another bar
wait 200
expect fresh 1
expect blits >-1
wait 1000
expect blits 0
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect fresh 1
wait 1000

expect fresh 1
# the counted beats (bars 4 and 8), each a moment later
wait 4300
expect fresh 1
wait 300
expect fresh 1
wait 300
expect fresh 1
wait 300
expect fresh 1
# a knob's box, held and fading
tap HOME
spin K3 2
wait 100
expect fresh 1
wait 500
expect fresh 1
wait 150
expect fresh 1
wait 150
expect fresh 1
wait 400
expect fresh 1
# a mute, another track, another bar, locked
tapkey b6
expect fresh 1
tapkey b6
tap OCT+
expect fresh 1
tapkey b2
expect fresh 1
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect fresh 1
